    {
      "id": "listFlightOffers",
      "label": "Search roundtrip flights",
      "description": "Read adult roundtrip flight offers using the current booking results route, avoiding the legacy prebooking redirect. Prices are starting roundtrip totals; no return flight or fare is selected. Location identifiers must match the selected airports/cities. Reports partial coverage of the loaded results.",
